#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.xlZUOpLye7/backend-markers.cpp:223
msgid ""
"Interval of keyframes / duration of GOPs for the transcode. \"0.0\" means to "
"match input (= the default), 'intra' means to send only key frames. "
"Otherwise, fractional seconds between keyframes."
msgstr ""
"Intervalo de fotogramas clave/duración de GOP para la transcodificación. "
"\"0.0\" significa hacer coincidir la entrada (= el valor predeterminado), "
