#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:80
msgid "Control when the process starts"
msgstr "Controlar cuándo comienza el proceso"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:91
msgid "Debug level"
msgstr "Nivel de depuración"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:92
msgid ""
"Debug message level for process. Default inherits from the stream setting."
msgstr ""
"Nivel de mensaje de depuración para el proceso. El valor predeterminado "
"hereda de la configuración de la transmisión."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:170
msgid "Generic process options"
msgstr "Opciones de proceso genéricas"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:219
msgid ""
"If set, this process need not be running for a stream to be considered fully "
"active."
msgstr ""
"Si se establece, no es necesario que este proceso se esté ejecutando para "
"que una transmisión se considere completamente activa."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:224
msgid "Inconsequential process"
msgstr "Proceso intrascendente"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:317
msgid ""
"Optional list of tags, if any of them are set on the stream, this process "
"does not start."
msgstr ""
"Lista opcional de etiquetas, si alguna de ellas está configurada en la "
"transmisión, este proceso no se inicia."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:346
msgid "Process start behaviour"
msgstr "Comportamiento de inicio del proceso"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:383
msgid "Restart behaviour"
msgstr "Comportamiento de reinicio"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:384
msgid "Restart delay"
msgstr "Retardo de reinicio"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:465
msgid "Tag inhibitor(s)"
msgstr "Inhibidores de etiquetas"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:511
msgid ""
"The time in milliseconds between restarts. If set to 0 it will restart "
"immediately"
msgstr ""
"El tiempo en milisegundos entre reinicios. Si se establece en 0, se "
"reiniciará inmediatamente"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:592
msgid ""
"What to do when the process exits or fails for any reason. Fixed waits the "
"restart delay every time. Exponential backoff will increase the delay up to "
"max the configured delay for each restart. Disabled will not restart the "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Qué hacer cuando el proceso sale o falla por cualquier motivo. Se corrigió "
"el retraso de reinicio cada vez. El retroceso exponencial aumentará el "
"retraso hasta alcanzar el máximo del retraso configurado para cada reinicio. "
"Deshabilitado no reiniciará el proceso."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.VjrRBXh5SM/backend-markers.cpp:598
msgid ""
"What tracks to use as inhibitors. If this track selector is able to select a "
"track, the process does not start. Defaults to none."
msgstr ""
"Qué pistas utilizar como inhibidores. Si este selector de pistas puede "
"seleccionar una pista, el proceso no comienza. El valor predeterminado es "
"ninguno."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:34
msgid "Annex B over WebSocket"
msgstr "Annex B sobre WebSocket"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:35
msgid "Annex B progressive over HTTP"
msgstr "Annex B progresivo sobre HTTP"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:162
msgid "Forward"
msgstr "Reenviar"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:163
msgid "Forward HTTP-pushed data over HTTP without further processing"
msgstr "Reenviar por HTTP los datos enviados mediante HTTP sin procesamiento adicional"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:181
msgid "H264/WS"
msgstr "H264/WS"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:199
msgid "HTTP Push Forwarder"
msgstr "Reenviador de push HTTP"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:206
msgid ""
"If empty, rejects the connection. Otherwise, response is parsed as local SRT "
"socket option overrides and applied to the newly accepted connection only. "
"This can be used to set the passphrase of the connection after receiving the "
"streamid, for example."
msgstr ""
"Si está vacío, rechaza la conexión. De lo contrario, la respuesta se "
"interpreta como anulaciones locales de opciones del socket SRT y se aplica "
"únicamente a la conexión recién aceptada. Esto se puede usar, por ejemplo, "
"para establecer la frase de contraseña de la conexión después de recibir el "
"streamid."

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:268
msgid ""
"local host:port (string)\n"
"remote host:port (string)\n"
"streamid (string)"
msgstr ""
"host:puerto local (cadena)\n"
"host:puerto remoto (cadena)\n"
"streamid (cadena)"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:375
msgid "Raw codec data over WebSocket"
msgstr "Datos de códec sin procesar por WebSocket"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:404
msgid "RTP-based SDP"
msgstr "SDP basado en RTP"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:445
msgid "SRT (Secure Reliable Transport)"
msgstr "SRT (transporte seguro y fiable)"

#: /var/folders/w8/0_1t6gv14p5gkdjjjvr3dgnm0000gn/T/tmp.PZ0WZ8JsmT/backend-markers.cpp:617
msgid "Whenever an incoming SRT connection is accepted"
msgstr "Cada vez que se acepta una conexión SRT entrante"

